rule StationOeeEscalation
	lineageTag: 26583300-4c60-50fb-a674-9132741b43db
	statement: Per the OEE Targets and Escalation policy, if a station's OEE stays below 60% for more than 15 minutes, notify the Line Manager, pause the station for triage, and follow section 4 of the station's SOP.

	ruleReferencedEntity equipment#Station

	ruleReferencedEntity knowledge#SOP

	ruleReferencedEntity equipment#Machine
		propertyScope: specific
		ruleReferencedProperty is_running
		ruleReferencedProperty actual_cycle_time

	ruleReferencedRelationship knowledge#SopForStation
